DeskTopSize 2 2
EdgeScroll 0 0
EdgeResistance 500
EdgeThickness 1

Style * BorderWidth 4, HandleWidth 4
Style * WindowFont "sans-serif:size=10:weight=bold"
Style * ClickToFocus, RaiseOnClick
Style * RandomPlacement, SmartPlacement

Style * MWMDecorHints, HintOverride
Style * FvwmBorder, FirmBorder
Style * DecorateTransient
Colorset 0 fg=#cccccc, bg=#1e1e1e, hi=#333333, sh=#111111
Colorset 1 fg=#ffffff, bg=#2d2d2d, hi=#444444, sh=#1a1a1a
Style * Colorset 0
Style * HilightColorset 1

Style * MenuColorset 0
Style * ActiveMenuColorset 1

TitleStyle LeftJustified
AddTitleStyle AllActive Colorset 1
AddTitleStyle AllInactive Colorset 0

BusyCursor DynamicMenu False, Read True
CursorStyle ROOT         left_ptr
CursorStyle TITLE        left_ptr
CursorStyle DEFAULT      left_ptr

# Mouse Button Context Modifiers Function
Mouse 0 4 A Iconify
Mouse 0 2 A Maximize 100 100
Mouse 0 6 A Close 

Mouse 1 T A Move
Mouse 1 W M Move
Mouse 1 F A Resize
Mouse 1 I A Iconify -1

Key Return A M-Mod1 Exec exec xterm
Key 1 A M GotoPage 0 0
Key 2 A M GotoPage 1 0
Key 3 A M GotoPage 0 1
Key 4 A M GotoPage 1 1

AddToFunc MoveRaiseMaximize
+ "C" Raise
+ "M" Move
+ "D" Maximize 100 100

Mouse 1 T A MoveRaiseMaximize

AddToFunc SwitchWindow
+ I FlipFocus
+ I Raise

Key Tab A M Next (CurrentDesk) SwitchWindow
Key Tab A S-M Prev (CurrentDesk) SwitchWindow

Mouse 1 R A Menu RootMenu

DestroyMenu RootMenu
AddToMenu RootMenu "Menu" Title
+ "Xterm" Exec exec xterm
+ "Firefox" Exec exec firefox
+ "" Nop
+ "Restart" Restart
+ "Exit" Quit

#AddToFunc StartFunction
#+ I Exec exec xterm

